{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sydney Kingsford Smith Airport is Australia's largest and busiest airport, serving as a major hub for both domestic and international travel.\u00a0</strong>The airport has three runways. The longest is 16R/34L at 3,962 meters, and there are two shorter runways, 16L/34R and 07/25.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sydney Airport operates under a curfew between 11 PM and 6 AM, which restricts flight movements to help mitigate noise for nearby residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Realistic modeling with over 100 custom modelled buildings including Terminal interiors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 New Gate 10, Kilo Ramp and Shopping Terminal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Detailed ground polygon model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Realistic Taxi signs and custom 3D taxi lights around the airport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Runway approach lighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Beautiful background scenery using OSM (open street map)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Realistic radar display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Various animations such as Buoys, T1 Elevator, Radars, Flags, and the famous Shark.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4019120?t=1758207522","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019120/8a88f2b38b96fb448933c577f51d9cde3bc3eedb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758207522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019120/d07f53c8ed730969f633b2953e6d6047068c18fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758207522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019120/d07f53c8ed730969f633b2953e6d6047068c18fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758207522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-p